// (Last Updated 19 October 2026), the IDL blocks of the interfaces
// XMLHttpRequestEventTarget, XMLHttpRequestUpload, XMLHttpRequest, FormData,
// ProgressEvent and the FormDataEvent of the HTML Standard, copied on
